                  "type": "listItem",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "A stay can be at most 30 nights; Paris (PAR) allows at most 14 nights."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
